{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 32, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark hark good traveler from lands afar\nLet me weave thy journey through Japans fair star\nNine days shalt thou roam where gods do tread\nAnd quaff the sweet nectar that lore hath fed\n\n**On the morn of the first day board thy steed**\nUnto the land of the rising sun so red\nIn Tokyos bustle with lights that gleam\nDown streets where neon and dreams do seem\nTo Shibuya’s heart do thou quickly go\nWhere scramble crosses hearts both fast and slow\nDine on yakitori and sake so fine\nThen rest thy limbs in a capsule fine\n\n**Upon the second dawn arise anew**\nTo Asakusa where temples tall do view\nSenso-ji’s gates with prayer and grace\nThen unto Akihabara’s electric space\nCollect rare trinkets and games so bright\nAs night doth fall do not delay in sight\nTo Shinjuku’s skyscrapers climb so high\nWhere Godzilla watches o’er Tokyo’s eye\n\n**The third day’s carriage shall carry thee**\nTo Nikko’s forests where cedars whisper free\nToshogu’s shrine with gold that dazzles near\nThen unto Yuba’s broth thou must repair\nReturn to Tokyo with heart held light\nBeneath the moon do stroll by Sumidas night\n\n**The fourth morn see thee aboard once more**\nTo Hakone’s onsen where geysers roar\nSteep thy bones in yunohana’s balm\nThen unto Owakudani’s hellish cauldron\nDine on black eggs with joy and glee\nSurvey Mount Fuji with wild abandon glee\n\n**On the fifth day let thy spirit take flight**\nTo Kamakura where giant Buddhas sit\nEnso Zen circles with brush in hand\nThen to Shimoda’s coast where waves command\nSavor kaisendon with flavors bold\nAs dusk descends on Enoshimas shore so cold\n\n**The sixth day shall bear thee to Kyoto’s embrace**\nThrough bamboo groves where whispers trace\nTo Kinkaku-ji’s golden image bright\nThen Arashiyama’s monkeys take their right\nCruise the river with paddle in hand\nPartake of matcha across the land\n\n**The seventh morn see thee to Nara’s grace**\nWhere deer bow low in sacred space\nTodai-ji’s Buddha with eyes so wise\nThen unto Kasuga’s lantern-lit skies\nReturn to Kyoto with heart held high\nWhere Pontocho’s alley calls thee nigh\n\n**On the eighth dawn let thy steps take flight**\nTo Osaka’s castle where heroes unite\nDine on takoyaki with joy so pure\nThen unto Universal’s world so sure\nWhere Harry Potter doth magic weave\nAs night doth fall let laughter cleave\n\n**The ninth and final day shall see thee depart**\nWith souvenirs and memories in heart\nFrom Kansai Airport homeward bound\nWith stories rich and sights profound\nThus ends thy tale from east to west\nIn Japan’s embrace both grand and blessed.", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.16029712557792664}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.0027155925054103136}, {"token": " h", "logprob": -2.221748113632202}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.0030251238495111465}, {"token": " good", "logprob": -0.4302396774291992}, {"token": " travel", "logprob": -0.4106396734714508}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.0008504349971190095}, {"token": " from", "logprob": -1.9012197256088257}, {"token": " lands", "logprob": -0.37535038590431213}, {"token": " af", "logprob": -0.16603806614875793}, {"token": "ar", "logprob": -0.0005899119423702359}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.5502471923828125}, {"token": "Let", "logprob": -1.228353500366211}, {"token": " me", "logprob": -1.4039777517318726}, {"token": " we", "logprob": -0.38935306668281555}, {"token": "ave", "logprob": -2.4914430468925275e-05}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -1.711660623550415}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -1.2823429107666016}, {"token": " through", "logprob": -0.6923709511756897}, {"token": " Jap", "logprob": -0.7663111686706543}, {"token": "ans", "logprob": -0.003724069334566593}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -1.0723844766616821}, {"token": " star", "logprob": -2.7473819255828857}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.6521201729774475}, {"token": "Nine", "logprob": -4.